	(text "DRIVE: exponential converter (Q1 / Q2, same reel, side by side on the board).\nV(DVC) = knob x 94 mV + CV x 19.4 mV / V; I_ABC = I_ref x exp(V(DVC) / 25.9 mV):\nabout 15 uA .. 0.59 mA over the knob (32 dB), 6.5 dB / V at the jack, limit about 0.95 mA (R35).\nSmall-signal gain IN -> OUT (wet): about x1 at DRIVE min, x35 at max."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 161.29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5a3b776e-74ad-5b25-8bab-e9fd31dd5e1f")
	)
	(text "INPUT + DRIVE VCA: IN -> -1 buffer (DRY) -> 15k -> OTA U5 (pins 1-5) with its linearizing diodes (I_D 1.05 mA):\nI_out = I_s x 2 I_ABC / I_D -> U1B (120k) -> U. Gain IN -> U = 0.11 (DRIVE min) .. 4.2 (max), exponential in the knob.\nU -> 10u -> 2k / 200R -> X (U / 11): the cells see 52 mV (2 V_T) per 0.57 V of U."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 73.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5a5a1a2a-0f4c-508e-b913-332bb877054e")
	)
	(text "FOLD: knob (0..48 uA) + CV (10 uA / V) -> U4B / Q3, current gain 42.7 -> four fold cells through 9.1k each.\nf = 1.0 at knob max or 5 V CV; limited to f = 1.06 (Q3 saturates, R26 stops the fold-back).\nNegative sums switch the fold cells off (D3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 208.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5eb09407-f388-5bd1-8d78-d12a02e7a039")
	)
	(text "Unused LM13700 Darlington buffers: left open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 322.58 137.16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7d1598ac-27ef-5158-87b2-573a33dba3e0")
	)
	(text "POWER: Eurorack +12V / -12V -> B5819W per rail -> +12V / -12V (about +/-11.6 V).\n+5V and pins 11-16 unused. 100n at every IC supply pin, 10u bulk per rail.\n15 .. 22 mA per rail (4 x TL072, 3 x LM13700; ngspice models)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "aa4f8d7f-482a-5af3-b18b-8252615e9a0e")
	)
	(text "TANH CELLS (one LM13700 half each, no linearizing diodes): I = I_ABC x tanh(V_d / 2 V_T). Outputs summed on YS -> U2A (10k) -> Y.\nB: soft clipper at I_0 = 0.52 mA. C / D: -tanh at X = +/-198 mV. E / F: +tanh at X = +/-405 mV. C..F run at f x I_0 (FOLD):\nY / 5.2 V = -[tanh(x) - f (tanh(x - t) + tanh(x + t)) + f (tanh(x - 2t) + tanh(x + 2t))], x = X / 52 mV, t = 3.8.\nf = 0: plain tanh overdrive. f = 1: two folds per side; the outer level stays at +/-5.2 V for every f."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 85.09 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c7e1d9c5-4f23-555b-a30e-56ab867f6d82")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG: #FLG01 marks the Eurorack GND; #FLG02/#FLG03 mark the +12V/-12V rails,\nfed from the header only through D1/D2, which ERC cannot see through."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "de9820c6-b36e-5fb6-a58b-c858081318e6")
	)
	(text "BIG MODULAR DRIVE - S1 schematic: OTA overdrive + wavefolder (3 x LM13700), DRIVE and FOLD under CV, TONE, dry / wet MIX. Circuit intent and ngspice results: docs/research.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e25464b7-c9b4-58e6-9735-27b629ee740e")
	)
	(text "WET PATH: Y -> 10u -> TONE (2k + 50k rheostat, 4.7n: 17 kHz .. 650 Hz) -> U2B (WET). MIX crossfades DRY (-IN) and WET (both inverted)\n-> follower -> inverter -> 1k (2512) -> OUT: the output has the input polarity for dry and wet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 266.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ef52fb0f-a287-5bff-b88e-a8fc746c4320")
	)
